{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id119787693"}, "name":{"label":"Wolpster"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-20T03:30:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.04.17"}, "id":{"label":"14325800889"}, "title":{"label":"Love it"}, "content":{"label":"I wrote the review below nine years so and it still holds true. Can’t say enough good things about Cozi. Moved up to gold and can always find anything when I need it! \n\nMy wife and I have forgotten what a paper calendar is!   We love Cozi.  It helps keeps us organized--which isn't easy with three children—12-year old twin girls and a 10-year old boy.    Thanks Cozi!  The mobile and iPad apps are simple to use.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
