{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1303259130"}, "name":{"label":"Pesto kid"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-18T21:52:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.04.17"}, "id":{"label":"14320978169"}, "title":{"label":"Best Organizational Calendar App (periodt 💅🏼)"}, "content":{"label":"Great color coding, the ability to easily copy and set dates for reoccurring events such as work is really helpful. As well as the fact you can put birthdays into it. Really easy to use and it’s great that it can be shared between devices. Great family or personal calendar.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id122063013"}, "name":{"label":"JLTG6"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-18T11:28:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.04.17"}, "id":{"label":"14319342051"}, "title":{"label":"Doesn’t play well with digital displays"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve subscribed to Cozi Gold since 2017 and love it, but will be cancelling my account. We have a digital display (Mango Display) and for months Cozi worked great. In February there was an update causing all day events to start at either 11pm the day prior or 4am day of. On very, very rare occasions it displays the start time correctly for a very short amount of time, we are talking a few minutes every few days/ weeks if that. I’ve watched the display flip start times between 11pm the day prior, 4 am day of and the correct all day time within seconds. I reached out to Cozi and their response was the calendar links port into Google Calendar correctly so it isn’t a problem on their end. That instead of selecting all day, time it from 0000 - 2359. Yeah, no. Mango Display cannot find the error on their part. I’ve tried other calendar links with Mango Display and all day events are displayed correctly leading to the belief that it is a Cozi issue. I give up since Cozi is unwilling to try and figure out the error to correct it. To me, it isn’t worth the price since it doesn’t perform how I need it to.\n\n\nEditing after developer response : \nI initially agreed with your reply that it was a Mango Display issue until I found others using different digital displays that were having the same issue!  If you do a google search, you will find posts from users of other platforms that have their all day events over multiple days due to start time. \nA work-around was adding my cozi calendar to my Google Calendar and having that sync with Mango Display. All day events displayed correctly in both Google Calendar and on my Mango Display. This brings me back to why am I paying for something that doesn’t work how I need it to and I’m using a free option to achieve my goal.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
